// 1_menus-03
// Bug: the Clear button on the monster Sabotages page only empties the slot display. The game cannot store "no sabotage" (the native save only knows the 8 sabotages and ignores any other name), so the old sabotage stays active.
// Fix: hide the Clear button, so the page always shows the sabotage the monster really has.

after PreConstruct {
    UI_ClearPerk.SetVisibility(1u8);
}
